    <div>
      <p begin="00:03.810" end="00:07.120" ttm:agent="v1">Gold teeth sittin' on the dash, she a rockstar</p>
      <p begin="00:07.120" end="00:10.470" ttm:agent="v1">Make your favorite singer wanna rap, baby, la, la</p>
      <p begin="00:10.470" end="00:14.000" ttm:agent="v1">&quot;Lisa, can you teach me Japanese?&quot; I said, &quot;はい, はい&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:14.000" end="00:17.410" ttm:agent="v1">That's my life, life, baby, I'm a rockstar</p>
      <p begin="00:17.410" end="00:18.910" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:17.810" end="00:20.900" ttm:agent="v1">Been on a mission, boy, they call me catch-and-kill</p>
      <p begin="00:20.900" end="00:24.290" ttm:agent="v1">I'm stealin' diamonds, make them chase me for the thrill</p>
      <p begin="00:24.290" end="00:27.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Been MIA, BKK so pretty (pretty)</p>
      <p begin="00:27.770" end="00:30.850" ttm:agent="v1">Every city that I go is my city</p>
