      <p begin="00:37.960" end="00:41.450" ttm:agent="v1">&quot;Lisa, can you teach me Japanese?&quot; I said, &quot;はい, はい&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:41.450" end="00:44.890" ttm:agent="v1">That's my life, life, baby, I'm a rockstar</p>
      <p begin="00:44.890" end="00:46.390" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:45.140" end="00:48.340" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a rockstar, I'm a rockstar</p>
      <p begin="00:48.340" end="00:51.690" ttm:agent="v1">It's not hype, hype, baby, make you rock-hard</p>
      <p begin="00:51.690" end="00:53.190" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:51.850" end="00:53.730" ttm:agent="v1">Make a wish, babe, what you wanna do?</p>
      <p begin="00:53.730" end="00:55.230" ttm:agent="v1">Dippin' out of big cities like a ponzu</p>
      <p begin="00:55.220" end="00:56.970" ttm:agent="v1">It's a fast life, it's an attitude</p>
      <p begin="00:56.970" end="00:58.650" ttm:agent="v1">Put it on the calendar and tell me when to come through</p>
      <p begin="00:58.650" end="01:01.970" ttm:agent="v1">Yes, yes, I can spend it, yes, yes, no pretendin'</p>
      <p begin="01:01.970" end="01:05.420" ttm:agent="v1">Tight dress, LV sent it, oh, shit, Lisa reppin'</p>
      <p begin="01:05.420" end="01:06.920" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:05.570" end="01:08.850" ttm:agent="v1">Been on a mission, boy, they call me catch-and-kill</p>
